        "Osial",
        "Childe"
      ],
      "comment": "Osial: Heart of Glaze (Childe awakens Osial)",
      "content": "After learning the Gnosis was not in the Golden House, Childe revealed a backup plan: he used Sigils of Permission, copied by Fatui research, together with the power the Tsaritsa gave him as a Harbinger, to loosen the Geo Archon's seal on Osial and release him toward Liyue Harbor, forcing Rex Lapis to show himself.",
