      "comment": "Osial: Monolith Fragment",
      "content": "A quest item received after the Turning Point battle: a fragment of the spear that pinned Osial. Its archive text recalls waves as tall as mountains and says that, though the thing in the deep awakens again, it cannot prevent a new era.",
