      "key": [
        "Vortex Vanquisher",
        "nine-headed hydra"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [
        "Rex Lapis",
        "Osial"
      ],
      "comment": "Osial: Vortex Vanquisher legend",
      "content": "The Vortex Vanquisher's text gathers sailors' legends: a great shadow that dragged ships into whirlpools, a rainbow-clad divine island, whales singing above the sealed spot, and a folk belief that the vortex will one day wake. All agree Rex Lapis pierced the rainbow with a spear and pinned the vortex.",
