        "Beisht",
        "Avenger of the Vortex"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [
        "Osial"
      ],
      "comment": "Osial: Beisht",
      "content": "Ningguang names Beisht as Osial's wife and the final follower of the Overlord of the Vortex. In 2.4 she rose to avenge him against the rebuilt Jade Chamber, was wounded by the Jade Chamber, the Guizhong Ballistae under Keqing and Beidou's ship, then by the Traveler and Shenhe, and fled. Her own file carries the details.",
