      "comment": "Osial: Abyss Order mechanised god plan",
      "content": "A talisman decoded by Dainsleif says the Abyss Order planned to use the Defiled Statue as a base, with Osial's limbs as its arms and the first Field Tiller's eye as its core, to create a machine to topple Celestia's thrones. Dainsleif meant to destroy the statue to prevent it.",
